Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Users and Organizations|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Organization Member
Priority: 5
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	When User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And MyAccount add Organization
		|organizationName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And Organization add Member CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userName|userfn userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And Organization goto CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|searchToken|Organization|
	Then Organization view Assign Member CP
		|userName|userfn userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
Scenario: Add Organizations
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	When MyAccount add Organization
		|organizationName|Organization Name 1|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And Organization search CP
		|orgName|Organization Name 1|
		|searchTerm|Organization Name 1|
	And MyAccount add Organization
		|organizationName|Organization Name 2|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And Organization search CP
		|orgName|Organization Name 2|
		|searchTerm|Organization Name 2|
	And MyAccount add Organization
		|organizationName|Organization Name 3|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	Then Organization search CP
		|orgName|Organization Name 3|
		|searchTerm|Organization Name 3|
Scenario: Delete Organization
Priority: 5
	Given ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	When MyAccount add Organization
		|organizationName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And Organization delete CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	Then Organization view No Organizations Found CP
Scenario: Edit Organization Site
Priority: 5
	Given ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	When MyAccount add Organization
		|organizationName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And Organization add Site CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site view CP
		|siteMember|Organization|
		|siteName|Organization Name|
		|siteType|Private|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And Organization edit Site CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|orgNameEdit|Organization Name Edit|
	And ProductMenu goto User My Account
		|portlet|My Organizations|
	And Organization search CP
		|orgName|Organization Name Edit|
		|searchTerm|Organization Name Edit|
	Then Organization view CP
		|orgName|Organization Name Edit|
		|orgType|Organization|
Scenario: View My Account
Priority: 4
	Given Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	When MyAccount view
Scenario: View My Account User
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	When User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	And MyAccount view
	Then User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
Scenario: View My Account Via Sign In Portlet
Priority: 4
	Given Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Sign In|
	When AssertClick the value 'Test Test' at locator 'SignIn#PORTLET_CONTENT_USER_NAME'
	Then MyAccount view